#: src/Application/Service/Mcp/McpSetupService.php:281
#. translators: 1: endpoint, 2: username, 3: server identifier, 4: display name, 5: write access state.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Connect my AI app to PublishPress. Create a setup script and give me the "
"exact terminal command to run it.\n"
"\n"
"1. Ask me to select my AI app and OS (Windows, macOS or Linux). Use "
"interactive choices if available, otherwise numbered options.\n"
"2. Create the script using your file tools. Request the specific permission "
"if needed. If you cannot write locally, attach a downloadable script. Only "
"fall back to code with save instructions when neither is possible. Use "
"PowerShell on Windows and an appropriate script on macOS or Linux. Do not "
"stop at explaining access limitations or provide only JSON.\n"
"3. Configure this local stdio server:\n"
"Name: %3$s\n"
"Display name: %4$s\n"
"Command: npx\n"
"Arguments: -y @automattic/mcp-wordpress-remote@latest\n"
"Environment: OAUTH_ENABLED=false, WP_API_URL=%1$s, WP_API_USERNAME=%2$s\n"
"Read WP_API_PASSWORD through a hidden terminal prompt.\n"
"Hub write access: %5$s. Only individually selected actions are exposed.\n"
"4. Check Node.js and npx. If missing, link to the official installer and "
"tell me to reopen the terminal. Back up existing settings. Use a JSON/TOML "
"parser or supported client command to merge only this server, preserving "
"other settings and sites. Stop on invalid configuration or a conflicting "
"endpoint. If replacing an old PublishPress desktop extension for this site, "
"guide me to disable only that extension to avoid duplicate connections. "
"Quote paths and values safely.\n"
"5. Give brief run, restart and approval instructions. Verify through the "
"connection or give me a prompt to test in the app: confirm the site URL, "
"list actual tools and perform a read-only lookup. Report whether write "
"tools are available. If expected write tools are missing, ask me to check "
"Allow actions that change site data and the selected actions in Hub, then "
"refresh the connection. Do not claim success from saved configuration "
"alone. Do not test writes during setup. Clarify the target site when "
"ambiguous and ask for review before changing site data."
msgstr ""
"So ohun elo AI mi pọ si PublishPress. Ṣẹda iwe afọwọkọ iṣeto kan ki o si "
"fun mi ni aṣẹ terminal gangan lati ṣiṣẹ rẹ.\n"
"\n"
"1. Beere lọwọ mi lati yan ohun elo AI mi ati OS (Windows, macOS tabi "
"Linux). Lo awọn aṣayan ibanisọrọ ti o ba wa, bibẹkọ ti awọn aṣayan ti a kà.\n"
"2. Ṣẹda iwe afọwọkọ naa nipa lilo awọn irinṣẹ faili rẹ. Beere fun "
"igbanilaaye pato ti o ba nilo. Ti o ko ba le kọ ni agbegbe, so iwe afọwọkọ "
"ti o le ṣe igbasilẹ pọ. Kan pada si koodu pẹlu awọn ilana fipamọ nigbati ko "
"si ọkan ti ṣeeṣe. Lo PowerShell lori Windows ati iwe afọwọkọ to yẹ lori "
"macOS tabi Linux. Ma ṣe da duro ni sisọ awọn ihamọ iraye tabi pese JSON "
"nikan.\n"
"3. Ṣeto olupin stdio agbegbe yii:\n"
"Orukọ: %3$s\n"
"Orukọ ifihan: %4$s\n"
"Aṣẹ: npx\n"
"Awọn ariyanjiyan: -y @automattic/mcp-wordpress-remote@latest\n"
"Ayika: OAUTH_ENABLED=false, WP_API_URL=%1$s, WP_API_USERNAME=%2$s\n"
"Ka WP_API_PASSWORD nipasẹ iwifunni terminal ti a pamọ.\n"
"Igbasilẹ rọọrun Hub: %5$s. Awọn iṣe ti a yan ni ẹyọkan nikan ni a fi han.\n"
"4. Ṣayẹwo Node.js ati npx. Ti o ba padanu, so si fifi sori ẹrọ osise ki o "
"sọ fun mi lati tun ṣii terminal. Pa awọn eto to wa tẹlẹ. Lo itupalẹ "
"JSON/TOML tabi aṣẹ alabara ti a ṣe atilẹyin lati darapọ mọ olupin yii "
"nikan, preserving awọn eto ati awọn aaye miiran. Duro lori iṣeto ti ko wulo "
"tabi aaye ipari ti o ni ija. Ti o ba n rọpo itẹsiwaju PublishPress atijọ "
"fun aaye yii, dari mi lati mu itẹsiwaju yẹn nikan ṣiṣẹ lati yago fun awọn "
"asopọ meji. Tẹ awọn ọna ati awọn iye ni aabo.\n"
"5. Fun awọn itọnisọna ṣiṣe, tun bẹrẹ ati ifọwọsi. Ṣayẹwo nipasẹ asopọ tabi "
"fun mi ni iwifunni lati ṣe idanwo ni ohun elo: jẹrisi URL aaye, atokọ awọn "
"irinṣẹ gangan ati ṣe iwadi kika nikan. Jabo boya awọn irinṣẹ kikọ wa. Ti a "
"ti nireti awọn irinṣẹ kikọ ba padanu, beere lọwọ mi lati ṣayẹwo Gba awọn "
"iṣe ti o yipada data aaye ati awọn iṣe ti a yan ni Hub, lẹhinna tun mu "
"asopọ naa. Ma ṣe sọ pe aṣeyọri lati fipamọ iṣeto nikan. Ma ṣe idanwo awọn "
"kikọ nigba iṣeto. Ṣalaye aaye ti a fojusi nigbati o ba jẹ ambiguous ki o "
"beere fun atunyẹwo ṣaaju yipada data aaye."

